st is only owners of commercial cleaning companies, found one company at a time. Every email is checked before it is ever sent.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_30", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1144, "y": -106, "width": 700, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 708506837, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1469118511, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_31", "type": "text", "x": 1166, "y": -90, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 652768598, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2100080515, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - EMAIL DELIVERABILITY, DOMAINS AND INBOX SETUP", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - EMAIL DELIVERABILITY, DOMAINS AND INBOX SETUP", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_32", "type": "text", "x": 1166, "y": -54, "width": 656, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1811180650, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 168393880, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Sending runs on separate domains so your main domain is never at risk. The starting size is\nour estimate for your first 10 calls, and month one replaces it with real numbers.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Sending runs on separate domains so your main domain is never at risk. The starting size is\nour estimate for your first 10 calls, and month one replaces it with real numbers.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_33", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2042, "y": -90, "width": 1048, "height": 218, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 333377415, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1347535309, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_34", "type": "text", "x": 2064, "y": -74, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1460814403, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1504004732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - COLD EMAIL COPYWRITING", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - COLD EMAIL COPYWRITING", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_35", "type": "text", "x": 2064, "y": -38, "width": 1004, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2133201996, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1959386987, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Each email reads like it was written to one owner about their own company. The follow-ups stay short and never repeat the first email.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Each email reads like it was written to one owner about their own company. The follow-ups stay short and never repeat the first email.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_36", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3290, "y": -106, "width": 1048, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 295334610, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 401991736, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_37", "type": "text", "x": 3312, "y": -90, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1159380354, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2036236842, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - CAMPAIGN MANAGEMENT AND OPTIMIZATION", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - CAMPAIGN MANAGEMENT AND OPTIMIZATION", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_38", "type": "text", "x": 3312, "y": -54, "width": 1004, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 279172787, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 260573196, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Replies are answered the same day and every email is tested weekly on whether it books calls. After month one we size the sending to reach\n30 calls.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Replies are answered the same day and every email is tested weekly on whether it books calls. After month one we size the sending to reach\n30 calls.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_39", "type": "rectangle", "x": 4516, "y": -134, "width": 720, "height": 290, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8fd0d8", "backgroundColor": "#e4f7f9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1329753548, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1914012529, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_40", "type": "text", "x": 4538, "y": -118, "width": 676, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0e5f6a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1222328496, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1656961616, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5 - BOOKING QUALIFIED SALES CALLS", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "5 - BOOKING QUALIFIED SALES CALLS", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_41", "type": "text", "x": 4538, "y": -82, "width": 676, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1490376254, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 96907016, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Only owners who could become your clients get onto your calendar. Every booked call is counted\nagainst your 10 to 30 a month.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Only owners who could become your clients get onto your calendar. Every booked call is counted\nagainst your 10 to 30 a month.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_1", "type": "rectangle", "x": -68, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1390851129, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 647892280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_42"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_2", "type": "text", "x": -56.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1695753999, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 207388625, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - We target owners of\ncommercial cleaning companies\nthat clean offices and sites", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_1", "originalText": "1 - We target owners of\ncommercial cleaning companies\nthat clean offices and sites", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_3", "type": "rectangle", "x": 280, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 311111476, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 404285458, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_4"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_42"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_43"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_4", "type": "text", "x": 292.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1570621945, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 249103478, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - We find each company on\nGoogle Maps and pull the\nowner's name and email", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_3", "originalText": "2 - We find each company on\nGoogle Maps and pull the\nowner's name and email", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_5", "type": "rectangle", "x": 628, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 922121677, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 161042649, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_6"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_43"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_44"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_6", "type": "text", "x": 640.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "